WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,960
Just share bikes

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:03,200
Where can I find a shared bicycle for you at this point?

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,160
You go back alone as a girl at night

4
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:06,920
Even if something happens, I will deliberately not go.

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:09,720
Thank you boss

6
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:18,980
Boss, right here

7
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:21,740
Thank you for sending me back inside.

8
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:32,940
Why did you come back if I didn't ask you to accompany grandma in the hospital?

9
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:34,600
I originally wanted to accompany

10
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:36,040
But grandma insisted on letting me come back

11
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,520
He also said that I would not go to work

12
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:38,640
She didn't even do surgery

13
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:40,380
That does look like a good old man.

14
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:42,380
Please hire a caregiver for anything you can do.
